      "id": "claim_d7134f6776504568a2d295f49f51a27a",
      "statement": "Enrichment runs before evaluation by design: the run orchestration replaces the document's markdown with the enriched markdown so that quality is scored on what will actually be ingested into RAG rather than on raw text containing opaque image placeholders.",
