    {
      "id": "claim_d3709fd71297436da9556a3b7b77f9d4",
      "statement": "Enrichment renders an image by rasterizing its whole page at a scale factor and cropping the pdfplumber bounding box scaled from points to pixels, rather than extracting the embedded image stream, which makes it robust to how the image was embedded in the PDF.",
