      "id": "claim_67359aac518a471d9c2c8c348de8aa1f",
      "statement": "ManualVLM re-reads an existing manifest at construction and indexes filled descriptions by placeholder, so a second run injects them during the normal enrichment pass and therefore before evaluation, preserving enrich-before-eval without a separate apply step; an unparseable manifest is treated as absent rather than fatal.",
